flowchart LR
	CALL["the model calls ccr_retrieve<br/>with the marker's hash"] --> EXACT["the hash matched exactly -<br/>no prefix or fuzzy matching"]
	EXACT --> SLICE["the range: start, count - slicing lines granularly,<br/>out-of-range bounds clamp"]
	SLICE --> OK["the success value {hash, type, size, text}<br/>rendered verbatim"]
	EXACT -. "the miss" .-> ERR["the self-describing error:<br/>re-run the original tool"]
